      "text": "🧩 UI Components\n\nLayout       shell (Sidebar+Navbar+outlet)\nNavbar       global search · notifications\nSidebar      nav links\nProtectedRoute  auth guard\nAutoLogout   15-min inactivity\nConfirmDialog  delete modal\n  (confirmText → type-to-confirm)\nNotificationDropdown\n\n🗺️ Routing\nHashRouter  (web + Electron file://)\nLazy-loaded pages with Suspense",
