      "updated": 1773163922118,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🖥️ Electron (desktop/)\n\nmain.ts  BrowserWindow, tray, IPC,\n  CSP, Origin injection, single-instance\npreload.ts  contextBridge →\n  window.electronAPI:\n  · getApiUrl() / setApiUrl()\n  · getAppVersion()\n  · showNativeNotification()\nconfig.ts  %APPDATA%\\Infra Manager\\\n  config.json (default: localhost:8888)\nlaunch.js  deletes ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE\n  (VS Code sets it → breaks Electron)\nelectron-builder.yml  NSIS installer\n  embeds frontend/dist/ as renderer/\n\n⚠️ vite.config.ts: base: './'\n  (required for file:// asset loading)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 335,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🖥️ Electron (desktop/)\n\nmain.ts  BrowserWindow, tray, IPC,\n  CSP, Origin injection, single-instance\npreload.ts  contextBridge →\n  window.electronAPI:\n  · getApiUrl() / setApiUrl()\n  · getAppVersion()\n  · showNativeNotification()\nconfig.ts  %APPDATA%\\Infra Manager\\\n  config.json (default: localhost:8888)\nlaunch.js  deletes ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE\n  (VS Code sets it → breaks Electron)\nelectron-builder.yml  NSIS installer\n  embeds frontend/dist/ as renderer/\n\n⚠️ vite.config.ts: base: './'\n  (required for file:// asset loading)",
