      "text": "FastAPI Middleware Stack\n\n🚦 slowapi Rate Limiter  /auth/token: 5 req/min · write endpoints: 20 req/min                   🔒 Security Headers  HSTS · X-Content-Type-Options · X-Frame-Options · X-XSS-Protection\n🌐 CORSMiddleware  Allowed origins: http://localhost:8080, http://localhost:5173, app://infra-manager            📝 RequestLoggingMiddleware  method · path · status · duration · client IP",
