      "text": "🔀 API Routers\n\nPOST /auth/token          login (bcrypt)\nPOST /auth/logout         blacklist JWT\nGET  /auth/me             validate token\n\nGET|POST   /projects\nGET|PUT|DELETE /projects/:id\nPOST /projects/:id/groups/:gid\nPOST /projects/:id/users/:uid\nPOST /projects/:id/servers\nPOST /projects/:id/databases\n\nGET|POST   /servers\nGET|PUT|DELETE /servers/:id\n\nGET|POST   /databases\nGET|PUT|DELETE /databases/:id\n\nGET|POST   /components\nGET|PUT|DELETE /components/:id\n\nGET|POST   /users\nGET|PUT    /users/:id\n\nGET|POST   /groups\nDELETE     /groups/:id\n\nGET /audit-logs\nGET|PUT /settings/:key\nGET /notifications/stream  (SSE)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 465,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔀 API Routers\n\nPOST /auth/token          login (bcrypt)\nPOST /auth/logout         blacklist JWT\nGET  /auth/me             validate token\n\nGET|POST   /projects\nGET|PUT|DELETE /projects/:id\nPOST /projects/:id/groups/:gid\nPOST /projects/:id/users/:uid\nPOST /projects/:id/servers\nPOST /projects/:id/databases\n\nGET|POST   /servers\nGET|PUT|DELETE /servers/:id\n\nGET|POST   /databases\nGET|PUT|DELETE /databases/:id\n\nGET|POST   /components\nGET|PUT|DELETE /components/:id\n\nGET|POST   /users\nGET|PUT    /users/:id\n\nGET|POST   /groups\nDELETE     /groups/:id\n\nGET /audit-logs\nGET|PUT /settings/:key\nGET /notifications/stream  (SSE)",
