      "updated": 1773163922118,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔐 Auth & RBAC (dependencies.py)\n\nget_current_user()\n  · Validate JWT HS256\n  · Check TokenBlocklist\n  · Return User or 401\n\nrequire_project_role(roles)\n  · Project must exist + not deleted\n  · Creator → full access\n  · Check ProjectGroupAccess\n  · Check ProjectUserAccess\n  · Superuser → bypass all checks\n  · 403 if no match\n\nget_accessible_project_ids()\n  · creator | group | direct user\n  · superuser → None (no filter)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 215,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔐 Auth & RBAC (dependencies.py)\n\nget_current_user()\n  · Validate JWT HS256\n  · Check TokenBlocklist\n  · Return User or 401\n\nrequire_project_role(roles)\n  · Project must exist + not deleted\n  · Creator → full access\n  · Check ProjectGroupAccess\n  · Check ProjectUserAccess\n  · Superuser → bypass all checks\n  · 403 if no match\n\nget_accessible_project_ids()\n  · creator | group | direct user\n  · superuser → None (no filter)",
      "index": "aX",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 0.9401709401709402
