      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚙️ Core Services\n\n🔒 encryption.py\n  EncryptedString → Fernet\n    (Server: password, ssh_key)\n    (ProjectServer: password, ssh_key)\n    (DatabaseEngine: password)\n    (ProjectDatabase: password)\n  EncryptedJSON → Fernet per-value\n    (Component.custom_fields)\n  Detected by 'gAAAAAB' prefix\n\n📋 audit.py  log_audit() on every\n  mutation · purged after 30 days\n\n💾 FastAPICache2\n  Redis backend (InMemoryCache fallback)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 215,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚙️ Core Services\n\n🔒 encryption.py\n  EncryptedString → Fernet\n    (Server: password, ssh_key)\n    (ProjectServer: password, ssh_key)\n    (DatabaseEngine: password)\n    (ProjectDatabase: password)\n  EncryptedJSON → Fernet per-value\n    (Component.custom_fields)\n  Detected by 'gAAAAAB' prefix\n\n📋 audit.py  log_audit() on every\n  mutation · purged after 30 days\n\n💾 FastAPICache2\n  Redis backend (InMemoryCache fallback)",
      "index": "aZ",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
