      "updated": 1773163922118,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⏱️ monitor.py (APScheduler)\n\n_monitor_executor ThreadPoolExecutor\n  (dedicated — never share with API)\n\nJob 1: Server TCP checks\n  · Ports 22, 80, 443\n  · Updates Server.is_online\n  · Updates Server.last_checked_at\n\nJob 2: Project HTTP checks\n  · GET primary_domain\n  · Updates Project.is_online\n  · Updates Project.last_checked_at\n\nOn state change:\n  → NotificationBus.publish(user_ids)\n  → per-user asyncio.Queue (cap 50)\n  → SSE push to frontend",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 215,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⏱️ monitor.py (APScheduler)\n\n_monitor_executor ThreadPoolExecutor\n  (dedicated — never share with API)\n\nJob 1: Server TCP checks\n  · Ports 22, 80, 443\n  · Updates Server.is_online\n  · Updates Server.last_checked_at\n\nJob 2: Project HTTP checks\n  · GET primary_domain\n  · Updates Project.is_online\n  · Updates Project.last_checked_at\n\nOn state change:\n  → NotificationBus.publish(user_ids)\n  → per-user asyncio.Queue (cap 50)\n  → SSE push to frontend",
      "index": "ab",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 0.8906882591093118
    },
