      "updated": 1773163922118,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🗑️ Soft Delete Pattern\nProject · Server · DatabaseEngine · Component\n  is_deleted: Bool\n  deleted_at: DateTime\n  Purged after 30 days by background job\n\n⚠️ ORM Pitfall: relationships do NOT\n  auto-filter is_deleted — filter\n  explicitly after loading\n\n🔗 Link Tables w/ Credential Overrides\n  ProjectServer\n    username?, password🔒?, ssh_key🔒?\n  ProjectDatabase\n    db_name?, username?, password🔒?\n  (override global defaults per project)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 215,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🗑️ Soft Delete Pattern\nProject · Server · DatabaseEngine · Component\n  is_deleted: Bool\n  deleted_at: DateTime\n  Purged after 30 days by background job\n\n⚠️ ORM Pitfall: relationships do NOT\n  auto-filter is_deleted — filter\n  explicitly after loading\n\n🔗 Link Tables w/ Credential Overrides\n  ProjectServer\n    username?, password🔒?, ssh_key🔒?\n  ProjectDatabase\n    db_name?, username?, password🔒?\n  (override global defaults per project)",
      "index": "ad",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.0576923076923077
