      "updated": 1773163922118,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔴 Redis  (optional, port 6379)\n\nFastAPICache2 backend\n  · Cache read endpoints\n  · Falls back to InMemoryCache\n    if REDIS_URL not set\n\nNotificationBus\n  · Per-user asyncio.Queue (cap 50)\n  · Uptime state-change events\n  · SSE delivery to clients",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 175,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔴 Redis  (optional, port 6379)\n\nFastAPICache2 backend\n  · Cache read endpoints\n  · Falls back to InMemoryCache\n    if REDIS_URL not set\n\nNotificationBus\n  · Per-user asyncio.Queue (cap 50)\n  · Uptime state-change events\n  · SSE delivery to clients",
      "index": "an",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2587412587412588
    },
