      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🐳 Docker Compose\n\nbackend:\n  host 8888 → container 8000\n  FastAPI + uvicorn\n\nfrontend:\n  host 8080 → container 80\n  Nginx serving React SPA\n\nredis:\n  6379 → 6379\n\nALLOWED_ORIGINS includes\n  app://infra-manager (Electron)\n  http://localhost:8080\n  http://localhost:5173",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 200,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🐳 Docker Compose\n\nbackend:\n  host 8888 → container 8000\n  FastAPI + uvicorn\n\nfrontend:\n  host 8080 → container 80\n  Nginx serving React SPA\n\nredis:\n  6379 → 6379\n\nALLOWED_ORIGINS includes\n  app://infra-manager (Electron)\n  http://localhost:8080\n  http://localhost:5173",
      "index": "ap",
      "frameId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 0.9276018099547512
